      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُمَاعٌ</span></b>  <i>A limping,</i> or <i>slight lameness</i> (IDrd,
S;) <i>a manner of going as though with a lameness;</i> a subst. from the above-mentioned verb.
(K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ خُمَاعٌ</span> [<i>He has a limping,</i>
&amp;c.]. (S.)

